Hi <%= @exhibitor_kit.pic_full_name %>,

Your exhibitor payment has been confirmed for <%= @event.title %>.

Booking Reference: <%= @booking_reference %>
Company: <%= @exhibitor_kit.company_name %>
Booth: <%= @booth_label %>
Amount Paid: RM <%= @exhibitor_kit.amount_paid %>
Payment Status: Paid

Payment Receipt
- Receipt No: EXH-<%= @booking_reference %>
- Payment Status: Paid
- Payment Date: <%= @exhibitor_payment&.paid_at.present? ? @exhibitor_payment.paid_at.in_time_zone.strftime("%B %d, %Y %I:%M %p %Z") : 'Not available' %>
- Amount Paid: <%= (@exhibitor_payment&.gateway_response&.dig('currency').presence || 'MYR') %> <%= format('%.2f', (@exhibitor_payment&.amount || @exhibitor_kit.amount_paid).to_f) %>
<% if @exhibitor_payment&.gateway_payment_id.present? %>
- Transaction ID: <%= @exhibitor_payment.gateway_payment_id %>
<% end %>
<% if @exhibitor_payment&.gateway_response&.dig('order_id').present? %>
- Order ID: <%= @exhibitor_payment.gateway_response.dig('order_id') %>
<% end %>

Your booth registration is now fully confirmed.

WHAT TO DO NEXT?
Your booth payment is confirmed. To prepare your exhibitor passes:
1. Log in to your exhibitor account at https://eventzflow.com.
2. Add your team members under your exhibitor account.
3. Each registered team member will receive an exhibitor pass with a QR code.

